{"id":"wb-8-365","name":"弦歌台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"弦歌台","text":"弦歌台，又称“厄台”、“绝粮祠”，位于中华人民共和国河南省周口市淮阳区淮宁街道，地处淮阳古城西南，是为纪念孔子周游列国期间的“陈蔡绝粮”历史故事而建的一座孔庙，为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A6%E6%AD%8C%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":94711126,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94711126","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d3906042244d40318ba4df1f.jpg","title":"20260913_Xian'getai_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260913_Xian%27getai_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/20260913_Xian%27getai_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南淮阳 弦歌台","width":320,"height":213}}